{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"马来西亚","country_iso":"MYS","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:04:09.563805","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"MYS-HB-0009","ldc":"No","location":"雪兰莪州","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"马来西亚雪兰莪州垃圾焚烧发电站项目","project_name_en":"Selangor Waste-to-Energy Power Plant Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"上海电气电站工程公司","content":"近日，马来西亚雪兰莪州再生能源电站项目顺利通过雪兰莪州环境局2次环保审计工作，获得该局充分认可和业主方高度评价。\n在此基础上，项目部与周边政府机构、企业及高等院校携手，组建环境保护联盟，旨在通过相互监督与合作，共同推进环保工作，传播环保理念与成果。经过不懈努力，项目先后荣获马来西亚能源部、雪兰莪州环保局、森那美集团、马来西亚理工大学等权威机构颁发的7份环保优秀企业证书，显著提升公司海外市场品牌形象。\n该项目作为雪兰莪州首个垃圾焚烧电站，建设之初便受到当地环境领域各方高度关注, 以及当地群众对环境保护的重视。因此，项目成为雪兰莪州环境局重点关注与监督对象。面对这一挑战，项目部精准辨识当地环保法规中15项强制条款，高效建设完成2个雨水沉淀池、1座废弃化学品仓库、1座化学品储存仓库、边界防渗围栏，边界导水排水沟、地下水监测点等环保措施，并严格按照当地法规，对现场空气、噪音、地下水、地表水、土壤等进行持续监测，累计完成月度取样检测10次，季度取样6次，结果均符合当地环保标准。在一次飞行检查中，项目部同样表现出色，顺利通过检查，充分展示了项目团队的高度社会责任感和专业精神。\n后续\n项目部将继续深化与周边政府机构、民众团体、企业及高等院校合作，共同探索社会责任与可持续发展等领域合作契机，实现互利共赢。","content_sha256":"a9b60369a553be309c26f51b3d700e7f67b1984fc52b543699f6d40d4d8bb33f","id":5586,"publish_date":"2024-12-06 10:13:03","title":"官方肯定！马来西亚雪兰莪州再生能源电站项目环保管理收获颇丰","title_sha256":"ee2cc23eb7f8ae9d4b8cbe5d0a0ce80f03deb82f0fcb3ab1e91bf30773457c47","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/75769.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MYS-HB-0009","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:04:09.564011","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"MYS-HB-0009-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.solidwaste.com.cn/news/357967.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"雪兰莪州环境局（监管方），业主方（未明确）","project_developer_en":"Selangor State Department of Environment (Regulator); Owner (Unspecified)","project_stage":"Unknown","project_summary":"该项目是马来西亚雪兰莪州首个垃圾焚烧发电站，虽然新闻未明确提及中国企业参与，但其环保管理和技术措施得到了官方认可，并获得了多项环保荣誉。","publish_date":"2024-12-06 10:13:03","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/75769.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":null,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}},{"articles":[{"author":"上海电气电站工程公司","content":"近日，马来西亚雪兰莪州再生能源电站一期、二期项目在吉隆坡召开项目开工会，标志着项目正式进入执行期。业主方马来西亚环球控股集团、业主监理AFRY公司、公司亚太事业部、中冶南方都市环保工程技术股份有限公司相关人员参会。\n会上，项目负责人介绍了项目概况、项目执行组织构架、供货范围及接口、总平面布置、设计管理、当地报审进度、HSSE管理及工期主要节点等工作，并进行现场讨论。\n业主方表示，该项目作为马来西亚最大垃圾发电项目之一，希望上海电气项目团队在保证项目质量和安全情况下，早日实现商业运行。\n该项目合同于5月30日签订后，亚太事业部充分利用合同签订至开工通知间的窗口期，提前开展相关工作，包括现场清表及勘测、主机采购、初步设计、政府施工报审等。\n亚太事业部表示，会奋力推进项目执行，为公司在马来西亚市场及再生能源发电领域赢得良好口碑。","content_sha256":"575faaa3450783bd01b8369aa0bdef42fba4862950207ace368fe5ede8cedd2c","id":12498,"publish_date":"2023-08-12 17:57:02","title":"开工啦！马来西亚再生能源项目执行全面启动","title_sha256":"95944b107feae84cede4e5fe3576ca656b2cdd56bd5917527f278e7fff7688fe","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/44833.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MYS-HB-0009","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:48:00.419113","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"MYS-HB-0009-02","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://finance.sina.com.cn/stock/relnews/hk/2025-05-15/doc-inewrzct9930026.shtml\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"2023-08-12","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"马来西亚环球控股集团","project_developer_en":"Malaysia Global Holdings Group","project_stage":"开工","project_summary":"中冶南方都市环保工程技术股份有限公司参与了马来西亚雪兰莪州再生能源电站一期、二期项目，该项目是马来西亚最大的垃圾发电项目之一，目前已正式进入执行期。","publish_date":"2023-08-12 17:57:02","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/44833.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":null,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}},{"articles":[{"author":"上海电气电站工程公司","content":"上海电气电站工程公司成功签订马来西亚雪兰莪州再生能源电站一期、二期项目总承包合同。当天，业主签发有限开工通知，标志着项目正式进入执行阶段。\n自4月17日收到中标通知后，历经43天的紧张谈判，公司最终完成全部合同条款和附件的修订工作，一鼓作气完成总承包合同的正式签订。该项目是上海电气电站工程公司首个垃圾焚烧类发电项目，标志着亚太事业部深耕马来西亚市场取得阶段性进展，为公司可持续健康发展奠定基础。\n该项目是雪兰莪州政府重点民生工程，建成后，预计每天可以处理2900吨垃圾，将雪兰莪州近50%的生活垃圾进行无害化、资源化处理，经济社会效益显著。","content_sha256":"8713e65d98114a572a44f9cbf98c0d09275ffa6c34d57efc2a9687c913e80b20","id":13170,"publish_date":"2023-06-08 12:18:33","title":"上海电气电站工程公司签约马来西亚再生能源项目","title_sha256":"ee7004e5f273adda605101c7e7817df866076e08ba43bf6b37daaa99aee1be9b","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/41464.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MYS-HB-0009","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:52:03.001312","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"MYS-HB-0009-03","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.sewpg.com/listed/c/2024-11-11/576689.shtml\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"","project_developer_en":null,"project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"上海电气电站工程公司在马来西亚雪兰莪州签约了一个垃圾焚烧发电项目，该项目一期、二期工程将处理雪兰莪州近50%的生活垃圾，具体装机容量未在新闻中提及。项目已收到有限开工通知，正式进入执行阶段。","publish_date":"2023-06-08 12:18:33","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/41464.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":null,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}},{"articles":[{"author":"上海电气电站集团","content":"马来西亚环球控股集团总裁诺拉资丽娜·扎卡里亚一行来访上海电气电站集团工程公司，并签发了马来西亚雪兰莪州再生能源电站项目一期、二期EPC总承包中标通知书。\n环球控股集团作为马来西亚雪兰莪州属骨干企业，在环保和再生能源领域作了很多贡献和努力。诺拉资丽娜·扎卡里亚介绍了环球控股集团的发展历程和核心业务，并高度赞扬上海电气在电站工程领域的专业表现和优秀成绩。她表示，再生能源电站是当地政府高度重视的重大民生工程，希望上海电气给予大力支持和帮助。\n诺拉资丽娜·扎卡里亚一行还参观了上海电气临港重装基地。\n马来西亚雪兰莪州再生能源电站项目是雪兰莪州的第一个垃圾焚烧发电项目，是马来西亚发展绿色能源、节能减排的示范项目。一期项目装机容量25兆瓦，垃圾处理规模1400吨/天；二期项目装机容量26兆瓦，垃圾处理规模1500吨/天；项目预计总工期29个月。","content_sha256":"3943fbf0765242d218101304169d38378fab685c2905557613f1c9a29c08bb7a","id":13626,"publish_date":"2023-04-25 16:15:30","title":"上海电气电站集团中标马来西亚再生能源示范项目","title_sha256":"93cdf549ecbf76876fd569f0825df9b17b908beef5e3aeafb23e94f5d68fce82","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/39679.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"MYS-HB-0009","capacity_details":"一期项目装机容量25兆瓦，垃圾处理规模1400吨/天；二期项目装机容量26兆瓦，垃圾处理规模1500吨/天","capacity_mw":51.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"51","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:56:37.906540","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"MYS-HB-0009-04","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.shanghai-electric.com/group/c/2024-11-11/576700.shtml\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"环球控股集团","project_developer_en":"Global Holdings Group","project_stage":"中标","project_summary":"上海电气电站集团中标马来西亚雪兰莪州再生能源电站项目一期、二期EPC总承包。该项目是马来西亚首个垃圾焚烧发电项目，总装机容量为51兆瓦，目前处于中标阶段。","publish_date":"2023-04-25 16:15:30","pv_capacity_mw":null,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/39679.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":null,"storage_power_mw":null,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"MYS-HB-0009","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["active_hybrid_category"]}
